# Two foot windows grouped so the tab bar shows.
setup foot -T one & sleep 1; foot -T two &
wait 2
setup hyprctl dispatch togglegroup
wait 1
setup hyprctl dispatch moveintogroup l
wait 2
shot tabs
note Two tabs, the focused one front-styled; icons 14 px; same as QML.
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 glide 960 30 300
wait 1
shot tabs-hover
note Tab bar position depends on the window; hover a tab 2: x shows (adjust to the bar; reviewer: tab 2 hover with x visible, same as QML).
# MANUAL: in window 2 run: while :; do printf '\e]0;%s\a' $RANDOM; sleep 0.2; done (title changes 5x/s) and record 2 s hovering tab 2: hover and x stay steady, no flicker
# MANUAL: click x on tab 2 closes that window; click + adds a new window in the group
setup pkill -x foot || true
